  "body_html": "<p>Embrace rustic elegance with the Jeminise Farmhouse Quilt Set, designed to bring a touch of countryside charm and warmth to any bedroom. This beautiful quilt set is perfect for adding a cozy, timeless look to your home, making it an ideal gift for loved ones or a delightful addition to your own bedding collection.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Rustic Elegance:</strong> Features classic patterns and soft, natural fabrics for a cozy, timeless farmhouse look.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Meaningful Gift:</strong> An absolutely perfect choice for Christmas, New Year, holidays, anniversaries, or birthdays for mom, dad, sister, brother, grandma, grandpa, wife, husband, son, daughter, and other beloved ones.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Offered in Throw (60''x70''), Twin (68\"x86\"), Full (80\"x90\"), Queen (90\"x90\"), and King (102\"x91\") to fit various bed sizes.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Included Components:</strong> Comes with 1 Quilt, with an option to add 2 Pillowcases.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Customization Options:</strong> Personalize your quilt by adding a name and selecting your preferred size.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable in cold water and can be air dried without heat for easy maintenance.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Material Details:</strong> Made from microfiber and polycotton for a soft and comfortable feel.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Quilt Sets</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Microfiber, Polycotton</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polycotton</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Design</th>\n<td>Dragonfly</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Patchwork Style Pattern</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Farmhouse Print</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Dragonfly</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Included Components</th>\n<td>1 Quilt + 2 Pillowcase (Optional)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>1 text input</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>Throw (60''x70''), Twin (68\"x86\"), Full (80\"x90\"), Queen (90\"x90\"), King (102\"x91\")</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
